    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Himbasha is a simple enriched bread. Cardamom gives it a distinctive scent, and the surface pattern pressed in before baking lets the segments pull apart at the table. Do not overbake: the top should reach a deep, even gold, not brown. The crust crisps slightly as it cools; inside the crumb stays soft."
          }
        ]
      },
